-- rewrite-imagem-edit-maqai.sql
-- Atualiza SOMENTE prompts.prompt_text para os 312 prompts type=Imagem,
-- reescritos para editar a foto enviada pelo usuario em vez de criar uma
-- maquina do zero (OPER "Reescrever os 312 prompts de Imagem" +
-- revisao de /vendaimg001-020).
--
-- Chave: code. Nao toca catalog_number, title, description, type,
-- category_id, segment, tools, image_url, tags ou is_active.
-- Idempotente: pode ser executado mais de uma vez sem efeito colateral,
-- pois cada UPDATE fixa o mesmo valor final de prompt_text.

begin;

update public.prompts set prompt_text = '/mudpower

Use the uploaded machine photo as the base image. Preserve the exact machine identity, proportions, cab, tracks/tires, attachments and visible branding — do not replace it with another model. Apply only this transformation: add realistic thick mud coverage and mud splashes frozen mid-air around the machine as if it just plowed through wet terrain, mud-caked wheels, warm late-afternoon golden light, dramatic low angle. Ultra-realistic result, 8k --ar 16:9' where code = '/mudpower';
update public.prompts set prompt_text = '/explodedview

Use the uploaded machine photo as the base image. Preserve the exact machine identity, proportions, cab, tracks/tires, attachments and visible branding — do not replace it with another model. Apply only this transformation: reconstruct the same machine as a 3D exploded-view diagram, its own parts (engine, cab, hydraulics, wheels/tracks) separated and floating in organized space with subtle guide lines, graphite-gray gradient background, premium technical-manual render style, studio lighting. Do not invent parts that aren''t part of the original machine. Ultra-detailed, 8k --ar 1:1' where code = '/explodedview';
update public.prompts set prompt_text = '/cinematic

Use the uploaded machine photo as the base image. Preserve the exact machine identity, proportions, cab, tracks/tires, attachments and visible branding — do not replace it with another model. Apply only this transformation: recompose the same machine backlit against a sunrise sky, fine dust particles suspended in the golden light beams, dark premium color grade with a bold yellow accent highlight, vertical composition. Ultra-detailed, 8k --ar 9:16' where code = '/cinematic';
update public.prompts set prompt_text = '/agro

Use the uploaded machine photo as the base image. Preserve the exact machine identity, proportions, cab, tracks/tires, attachments and visible branding — do not replace it with another model. Apply only this transformation: place the same machine in an epic wide farmland setting at sunset, golden dust suspended in the air, dramatic orange-and-purple sky, low heroic angle. Ultra-realistic, 8k --ar 16:9' where code = '/agro';
update public.prompts set prompt_text = '/nightoperation

Use the uploaded machine photo as the base image. Preserve the exact machine identity, proportions, cab, tracks/tires, attachments and visible branding — do not replace it with another model. Apply only this transformation: place the same machine operating at night in an open-pit mine, powerful headlights cutting through airborne dust, illuminated sparks and dust particles, low-angle heroic composition, epic industrial atmosphere. Ultra-detailed, 8k --ar 16:9' where code = '/nightoperation';
update public.prompts set prompt_text = '/xraymachine

Use the uploaded machine photo as the base image. Preserve the exact machine identity, proportions, cab, tracks/tires, attachments and visible branding — do not replace it with another model. Apply only this transformation: transform the same machine into an X-ray style visualization, showing its own internal structure, engine, gears and hydraulic system in translucent cyan-blue layers over a black background, futuristic technical aesthetic, high contrast. Ultra-detailed, 8k --ar 16:9' where code = '/xraymachine';
update public.prompts set prompt_text = '/machinebreakdown

Use the uploaded machine photo as the base image. Preserve the exact machine identity, proportions, cab, tracks/tires, attachments and visible branding — do not replace it with another model. Apply only this transformation: reveal a realistic technical cutaway of the same machine, exposing the damaged internal component ([engine/transmission/hydraulics]) in sharp focus, industrial studio lighting, graphite-gray background, premium technical-diagram style. Ultra-detailed, realistic, 8k --ar 3:4' where code = '/machinebreakdown';
