Use the uploaded machine photo as the base image. Preserve the exact machine identity, proportions, cab, tracks/tires, attachments and visible branding — do not replace it with another model. Apply only this transformation: add realistic mud and dust coverage as if after an extreme workday, visible scratches and wear on the bodywork, blurred heavy-duty worksite in the background, hard side lighting. Ultra-realistic result, 8k --ar 4:5' where code = '/heavyduty';
